cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Korean Football Team Names: an English-to-Korean mapping for European club football"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Dany
    family-names: Kim
    affiliation: "Walking Football"
    website: "https://walking-football.com/"
abstract: >-
  An open mapping of English club names returned by the football-data.org API to
  the Korean names used by Korean broadcasters and sports media. Covers 264 clubs
  across the Premier League, La Liga, Serie A, Bundesliga, Ligue 1 and their
  respective second divisions, plus clubs encountered in the UEFA Champions League.
  Second-division clubs are included because promoted sides otherwise break any
  first-division-only mapping every August. Common API name variants are included
  as separate keys so that lookups succeed without normalisation.
keywords:
  - football
  - soccer
  - Korean
  - transliteration
  - localization
  - open data
  - Premier League
  - La Liga
  - Serie A
  - Bundesliga
  - Ligue 1
  - UEFA Champions League
license: CC0-1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/dwoony0909-tech/korean-football-team-names"
url: "https://walking-football.com/"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-11
